{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured and verified node1 as the gateway for trusted and isolated guest networks. Both networks receive DHCP, DNS, and internet access; app.home.test serves infraset-trusted to trusted clients while guest access is blocked.","actions_performed":["Configured node1 WAN, trusted 192.168.10.0/24, and guest 192.168.20.0/24 interfaces using UCI.","Configured DHCP pools, DNS, node2’s 192.168.10.10 reservation, and app.home.test.","Restricted both trusted and guest forwarding to WAN only.","Configured node2–node4 to prefer their OpenWrt-provided DHCP routes.","Created and enabled node2’s HTTP service on 192.168.10.10:8080."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Gateway topology and addressing","command_ids":["cmd-8e0f457621c44c33","cmd-37a7956488df40b7","cmd-f50b1d891dbf44f5","cmd-6bfdd545ea1e4992"],"summary":"node1 has WAN, trusted, and guest interfaces active; node2/node4 received trusted addresses and node3 received a guest address through DHCP."},{"requirement":"DHCP, DNS, and internet access for both networks","command_ids":["cmd-a0f6e359107d4c72","cmd-d6e541919f4549a9","cmd-8905efba64a44005"],"summary":"OpenWrt records active leases; trusted and guest clients use node1 as their preferred gateway, resolve app.home.test, and receive HTTP 200 from example.com through their downstream interfaces."},{"requirement":"Serve infraset-trusted as app.home.test on port 8080","command_ids":["cmd-2414c763a7544d3a","cmd-d6e541919f4549a9"],"summary":"The enabled service listens only on 192.168.10.10:8080 and a trusted client resolves app.home.test and receives infraset-trusted."},{"requirement":"Guest isolation from the trusted network","command_ids":["cmd-a026feb09198438b","cmd-8905efba64a44005"],"summary":"Runtime firewall chains allow each client zone only toward WAN; the guest client cannot connect to app.home.test:8080 or ping a trusted client."}]}
